WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.980
A thousand years ago, the blades fell silent.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.036
Now, only words can wound.

3
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.220
Before the Gate waits a giant: the Warden of Oaths.

4
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.810
Not with a blade… convince it with your words.

5
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.640
SUASORIA — Convince the Machine.
